Here is the complete, client-side static web application for **The Griffin Universe Bible**. It is built with pure HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, requiring no frameworks, build tools, or server dependencies. It works perfectly from `file://` and is ready for GitHub Pages.

### 1. `index.html`
The main structure featuring a collapsible sidebar, persistent top bar with search and tools, and a dynamic content area.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>The Griffin Universe Bible</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div id="app">
    <!-- Sidebar Navigation -->
    <aside id="sidebar" class="sidebar">
      <div class="sidebar-header">
        <h2>Griffin Universe</h2>
        <button id="close-sidebar" class="icon-btn no-print">&times;</button>
      </div>
      <nav class="sidebar-nav">
        <a href="#" data-section="dashboard" class="nav-link active">Dashboard</a>
        <a href="#" data-section="characters" class="nav-link">Characters</a>
        <a href="#" data-section="books" class="nav-link">Books</a>
        <a href="#" data-section="timeline" class="nav-link">Timeline</a>
        <a href="#" data-section="locations" class="nav-link">Locations</a>
        <a href="#" data-section="families" class="nav-link">Families</a>
        <a href="#" data-section="organisations" class="nav-link">Organisations</a>
        <a href="#" data-section="relationships" class="nav-link">Relationships</a>
        <a href="#" data-section="themes" class="nav-link">Themes</a>
        <a href="#" data-section="mysteries" class="nav-link">Mysteries</a>
        <a href="#" data-section="secrets" class="nav-link">Secrets</a>
        <a href="#" data-section="historicalEvents" class="nav-link">Historical Events</a>
        <a href="#" data-section="futureIdeas" class="nav-link">Future Ideas</a>
        <a href="#" data-section="scratchpad" class="nav-link">Scratchpad</a>
      </nav>
    </aside>

    <!-- Main Content Area -->
    <div class="main-wrapper">
      <!-- Top Bar -->
      <header id="topbar" class="topbar no-print">
        <button id="toggle-sidebar" class="icon-btn">&#9776;</button>
        <div class="search-container">
          <input type="text" id="search-input" placeholder="Search universe (names, notes, ideas...)">
          <button id="search-btn" class="btn-small">Search</button>
        </div>
        <div class="topbar-actions">
          <button id="theme-toggle" class="btn-small">Toggle Theme</button>
          <button id="import-btn" class="btn-small">Import JSON</button>
          <input type="file" id="file-input" accept=".json" style="display: none;">
          <button id="export-btn" class="btn-small">Export JSON</button>
          <button id="report-btn" class="btn-small">HTML Report</button>
          <button id="print-btn" class="btn-small">Print / PDF</button>
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- Dynamic Content -->
      <main id="content" class="content">
        <!-- Content injected by app.js -->
      </main>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Modal for Forms -->
  <div id="modal" class="modal no-print">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <span id="close-modal" class="close-modal">&times;</span>
      <h2 id="modal-title">Edit Entry</h2>
      <form id="entity-form"></form>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Toast Notification -->
  <div id="toast" class="toast">Saved!</div>

  <script src="app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
```

### 2. `styles.css`
Features a dark mode default (using the preferred `#050202` background), a darker blue highlight for search results, responsive design, vertical timeline styling, and CSS-only family tree rendering.

```css
/* --- CSS Variables & Theming --- */
:root {
  --bg-color: #050202;
  --text-color: #e0e0e0;
  --sidebar-bg: #0a0505;
  --card-bg: #110808;
  --border-color: #2a1a1a;
  --accent-color: #1e3a5f;
  --accent-hover: #2a4a6f;
  --highlight-bg: #1e3a5f; /* Darker blue highlight for search */
  --danger-color: #8b2635;
}

.light-mode {
  --bg-color: #ffffff;
  --text-color: #1a1a1a;
  --sidebar-bg: #f5f5f5;
  --card-bg: #ffffff;
  --border-color: #dddddd;
  --accent-color: #2563eb;
  --accent-hover: #1d4ed8;
  --highlight-bg: #dbeafe;
}

/* --- Global Reset & Base --- */
* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
body {
  font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
  background-color: var(--bg-color);
  color: var(--text-color);
  line-height: 1.6;
  transition: background-color 0.3s, color 0.3s;
}

/* --- Layout --- */
#app { display: flex; height: 100vh; overflow: hidden; }
.sidebar {
  width: 260px;
  background-color: var(--sidebar-bg);
  border-right: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  z-index: 100;
}
.sidebar.collapsed { transform: translateX(-260px); position: absolute; height: 100%; }
.main-wrapper { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }

/* --- Sidebar --- */
.sidebar-header { padding: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
.sidebar-nav { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 10px 0; }
.nav-link {
  display: block; padding: 12px 20px; color: var(--text-color); text-decoration: none;
  border-left: 3px solid transparent; transition: all 0.2s;
}
.nav-link:hover, .nav-link.active { background-color: var(--card-bg); border-left-color: var(--accent-color); }

/* --- Topbar --- */
.topbar {
  padding: 15px 20px; background-color: var(--card-bg); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px; flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.search-container { flex: 1; display: flex; gap: 10px; min-width: 200px; }
#search-input {
  flex: 1; padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 4px;
  background-color: var(--bg-color); color: var(--text-color);
}
.topbar-actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

/* --- Buttons --- */
.icon-btn, .btn-small, .btn-primary, .btn-danger {
  padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 4px;
  background-color: var(--card-bg); color: var(--text-color); cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;
}
.btn-primary { background-color: var(--accent-color); border-color: var(--accent-color); color: white; }
.btn-primary:hover { background-color: var(--accent-hover); }
.btn-danger { background-color: var(--danger-color); border-color: var(--danger-color); color: white; }
.icon-btn { padding: 8px; font-size: 1.2em; }

/* --- Content Area --- */
.content { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 20px; }
.section-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }

/* --- Cards & Lists --- */
.card-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
.card {
  background-color: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 20px; transition: transform 0.2s;
}
.card:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); border-color: var(--accent-color); }
.card h3 { margin-bottom: 10px; color: var(--accent-color); }

/* --- Dashboard --- */
.dashboard-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr)); gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
.stat-card { background-color: var(--card-bg); padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
.stat-card h3 { font-size: 2.5em; margin-bottom: 5px; color: var(--accent-color); }
.dashboard-section { margin-bottom: 30px; }
.dashboard-section ul { list-style: none; padding-left: 0; }
.dashboard-section li { padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); }

/* --- Forms --- */
.form-group { margin-bottom: 15px; }
.form-group label { display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.9em; }
.form-group input, .form-group select, .form-group textarea {
  width: 100%; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 4px;
  background-color: var(--bg-color); color: var(--text-color);
}
.form-group textarea { min-height: 100px; resize: vertical; }
.full-width-textarea { width: 100%; height: 60vh; }

/* --- Badges & Links --- */
.badge {
  display: inline-block; padding: 4px 8px; background-color: var(--highlight-bg);
  border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.85em; margin: 2px; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; color: var(--text-color);
}
.badge:hover { filter: brightness(1.2); }

/* --- Timeline --- */
.timeline-controls { margin-bottom: 20px; display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.timeline-container { position: relative; padding-left: 30px; }
.timeline-container::before {
  content: ''; position: absolute; left: 10px; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 2px; background: var(--accent-color);
}
.timeline-event {
  position: relative; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 15px; background: var(--card-bg);
  border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
}
.timeline-event::before {
  content: ''; position: absolute; left: -24px; top: 20px; width: 10px; height: 10px;
  border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent-color);
}
.timeline-year { font-weight: bold; color: var(--accent-color); font-size: 1.2em; }

/* --- Family Tree (CSS Only) --- */
.family-tree ul { padding-top: 20px; position: relative; display: flex; justify-content: center; }
.family-tree li { float: left; text-align: center; list-style-type: none; position: relative; padding: 20px 5px 0 5px; }
.family-tree li::before, .family-tree li::after {
  content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; right: 50%; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); width: 50%; height: 20px;
}
.family-tree li::after { right: auto; left: 50%; border-left: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
.family-tree li:only-child::after, .family-tree li:only-child::before { display: none; }
.family-tree li:only-child { padding-top: 0; }
.family-tree li:first-child::before, .family-tree li:last-child::after { border: 0 none; }
.family-tree li:last-child::before { border-right: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 0 5px 0 0; }
.family-tree li:first-child::after { border-radius: 5px 0 0 0; }
.family-tree ul ul::before {
  content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 50%; border-left: 1px solid var(--border-color); width: 0; height: 20px;
}
.tree-node {
  border: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 10px 15px; text-decoration: none; color: var(--text-color);
  background: var(--card-bg); display: inline-block; border-radius: 5px; transition: all 0.3s;
}
.tree-node:hover { background: var(--accent-color); color: white; }

/* --- Modal --- */
.modal {
  display: none; position: fixed; z-index: 200; left: 0; top: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
  background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.7); overflow-y: auto;
}
.modal-content {
  background-color: var(--card-bg); margin: 5% auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  border-radius: 8px; width: 90%; max-width: 600px; position: relative;
}
.close-modal { position: absolute; right: 20px; top: 15px; font-size: 28px; cursor: pointer; }

/* --- Toast --- */
.toast {
  visibility: hidden; min-width: 250px; background-color: var(--accent-color); color: white;
  text-align: center; border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px; position: fixed; z-index: 300;
  left: 50%; bottom: 30px; transform: translateX(-50%);
}
.toast.show { visibility: visible; animation: fadein 0.5s, fadeout 0.5s 2.5s; }
@keyframes fadein { from {bottom: 0; opacity: 0;} to {bottom: 30px; opacity: 1;} }
@keyframes fadeout { from {bottom: 30px; opacity: 1;} to {bottom: 0; opacity: 0;} }

/* --- Search Highlight --- */
.search-result { margin-bottom: 15px; padding: 15px; background: var(--card-bg); border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-color); }
.search-result .type { font-size: 0.8em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent-color); font-weight: bold; }
.search-result .snippet { background-color: var(--highlight-bg); padding: 2px 4px; border-radius: 3px; }

/* --- Print / PDF Friendly --- */
@media print {
  .no-print, #sidebar, #topbar, .modal, .toast { display: none !important; }
  #app { display: block; height: auto; overflow: visible; }
  .main-wrapper { overflow: visible; }
  .content { padding: 0; overflow: visible; }
  body { background-color: white !important; color: black !important; }
  .card, .timeline-event, .tree-node { 
    background-color: white !important; color: black !important; border: 1px solid #ccc !important; 
    break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .timeline-container::before { background: #ccc !important; }
  .timeline-event::before { background: #ccc !important; }
  a { text-decoration: none; color: black !important; }
}

/* --- Responsive --- */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .sidebar { position: absolute; height: 100%; transform: translateX(-260px); }
  .sidebar.open { transform: translateX(0); }
  .topbar { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
  .search-container { order: 2; }
  .topbar-actions { order: 3; justify-content: space-between; }
}
```

### 3. `app.js`
Contains all application logic: state management, CRUD operations, dynamic form generation, search, filtering, timeline visualization, family tree rendering, and import/export utilities.

