### Instructions for Use:
1. Save all four blocks into the same folder as `index.html`, `styles.css`, `app.js`, and `sample-data.json`.
2. Open `index.html` directly in any modern web browser (it works via `file://`).
3. The app will auto-load the sample data on first run. You can also manually click **Import JSON** and select `sample-data.json`.
4. All changes auto-save to your browser's `localStorage`. Use **Export JSON** to create a backup file.
5. Click **Print / PDF** to generate a clean, printer-friendly document of your current view.